WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
A solid electron-density envelope surrounds a 17-atom C7H10 molecule.
Density is 0.04 electrons/bohr³ on a 256³ grid.

00:07.500 --> 00:15.800
The X-ray shader reveals the atoms inside.
Changing maxOpacity redraws the same mesh immediately.

00:15.800 --> 00:27.000
The clipping shader opens the envelope.
Changing zmax moves the boundary through the surface.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Install EigenVista and try the downloadable examples:
uvar-apps.github.io/eigenvista
